  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When debugging collider behavior, it's often helpful to move bones manually while watching how the physbones/colliders are responding. However, currently selecting another transform will hide the physbone/collidier gizmos if they do not parent up to that transform. It would be very useful to be able to select specific colliders/physbones/contacts and force their gizmos to remain visible when unselected.",
